  "about": "The re-shoot's Schedule shot: a day's evening on Safelight's Schedule as a timelapse, from 17:15 to 22:45: the screen plain white in the afternoon, then from 17:30 warmer and dimmer, the color filter coming on in amber at 18:25 and deepening to orange, the switch to Dark at 20:30, played in real time as macOS fades the screen and dissolves the wallpaper, and a deep, dim red by 22:30. Safelight's own schedule code sets every minute from its own timer; the menu bar's clock shows the time. As day-timelapse, filmed by two fixed panes, the whole screen and the popover close up with the menu bar's clock, with no camera move",
